      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a href=\"ZipCompression.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.gradle.tasks.bundling\"><code>ZipCompression</code></a> that should be used when adding the file\nrepresented by the given <code>details</code> to the jar. By default, any\n<a href=\"#isLibrary(org.gradle.api.file.FileCopyDetails)\"><code>library</code></a> is <a href=\"ZipCompression.html#STORED\"><code>stored</code></a>\nand all other files are <a href=\"ZipCompression.html#DEFLATED\"><code>deflated</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回在将给定 <code>details` 表示的文件添加到 jar 时应使用的<a href=\"ZipCompression.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.boot.gradle.tasks.bundling\"><code>ZipCompression</code></a>。默认情况下，任何<a href=\"#isLibrary(org.gradle.api.file.FileCopyDetails)\"><code>library</code></a>均被<a href=\"ZipCompression.html#STORED\"><code>stored</code></a>，而所有其他文件则被<a href=\"ZipCompression.html#DEFLATED\"><code>deflated</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
